Comment: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:05.00,Default,,0,0,0,,------------------------------------------------------
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.80,0:00:13.30,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Legends of Sports Heroes: Dunk for Victories.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.52,0:00:16.80,Title,,0,0,0,,Champion
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.16,0:12:36.96,end,,0,0,0,,End…
Comment: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:05.00,Default,,0,0,0,,------------------------------------------------------
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.92,0:00:23.24,Default,,0,0,0,,In the previous episode, Victor single-handedly dominated Team Defenders,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.56,0:00:28.48,Default,,0,0,0,,but he was gradually countered by Team Defenders as they shifted to a team-oriented style of play.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.36,0:00:33.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Falling behind, Victor saw his teammates working hard,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.40,0:00:36.36,Default,,0,0,0,,and surprisingly handed the offensive reins over to them.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.96,0:00:46.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Your old injury has flared up; you can’t keep playing.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.12,0:00:49.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Otherwise, even walking normally might become a problem later on.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.88,0:00:50.72,Default,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.08,0:00:56.24,Default,,0,0,0,,It looks like Team Defenders will have to send Paddi in.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.76,0:00:58.72,Default,,0,0,0,,I’m ready to sub in at any time.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.84,0:01:01.44,Default,,0,0,0,,No…
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.24,0:01:10.64,Default,,0,0,0,,I can still go on.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.92,0:01:14.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Now isn’t the time to be stubborn.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.96,0:01:16.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Your injuries are too severe.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:17.16,0:01:19.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Listen to Mr. Slowy; you need to get some proper rest.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:20.48,0:01:22.48,Default,,0,0,0,,We’ll win the match for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.40,0:01:29.12,Default,,0,0,0,,—As long as I can still walk, I can keep competing.　—Weslie!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.52,0:01:31.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Coach.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:31.92,0:01:33.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Without my permission,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.92,0:01:35.64,Default,,0,0,0,,no one is allowed to step onto the court.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:36.12,0:01:37.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Coach!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:37.68,0:01:40.72,Default,,0,0,0,,I don’t want you to regret this impulsive decision later.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:41.08,0:01:42.40,Default,,0,0,0,,I won’t regret it.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:42.96,0:01:47.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Even if you might never be able to walk normally again, you’d still insist on playing?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:53.04,0:01:55.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Coach, if it were you,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:55.48,0:01:57.88,Default,,0,0,0,,you would make the same decision I did.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:59.56,0:02:01.68,Default,,0,0,0,,I want to get out there.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:01.68,0:02:03.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Not just for the win,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.36,0:02:08.68,Default,,0,0,0,,but to fight alongside my teammates until the very last second.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.68,0:02:11.40,Default,,0,0,0,,I don’t want to have any regrets.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.40,0:02:16.64,Default,,0,0,0,,You’re so stubborn.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:16.80,0:02:17.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Coach.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:20.44,0:02:23.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Ref, no substitution needed. The game continues.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.08,0:02:27.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Go on. Don’t leave any regrets.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.04,0:02:32.80,Default,,0,0,0,,The game continues.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.16,0:02:37.72,Default,,0,0,0,,You’d better give it your all—for both of us.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.96,0:02:39.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Otherwise, I could sub in for you at any moment.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.16,0:02:42.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Remember that. When you can’t hold on anymore,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.04,0:02:44.48,Default,,0,0,0,,you can lean on us.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.64,0:02:47.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Don’t forget, we’re a team.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.56,0:02:50.04,Default,,0,0,0,,I’ll definitely give it my all.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.80,0:02:51.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Let’s go!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.24,0:02:54.44,Default,,0,0,0,,I’m counting on you guys. Go!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.32,0:03:05.44,Default,,0,0,0,,The defense is so tight; it’s hard to pass the ball out.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.92,0:03:20.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Team Defenders had the ball stolen immediately after the timeout.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.00,0:03:23.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Team Wolves’ reaction time is truly amazing.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.28,0:03:36.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Team Wolves!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.76,0:03:37.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Nice shot.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.92,0:03:41.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Don’t let it get to you; keep pushing.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.72,0:03:47.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Both sides have entered the scoring frenzy phase.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.80,0:03:50.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Team Wolves is mounting a fierce offensive.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.40,0:03:52.72,Default,,0,0,0,,But Team Defenders isn’t backing down either.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.28,0:03:55.04,Default,,0,0,0,,The gap is down to just three points.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.32,0:04:00.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Ref—
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.68,0:04:07.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Weslie is trying to get back on his feet.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.40,0:04:10.96,Default,,0,0,0,,That tenacious spirit is truly admirable.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.56,0:04:16.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you trying to be a hero all by yourself again?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.08,0:04:23.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Not at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.28,0:04:27.76,Default,,0,0,0,,There’s less than a minute left in the game.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.16,0:04:31.04,Default,,0,0,0,,If Team Defenders can’t stop this attack by Team Wolves,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.32,0:04:33.80,Default,,0,0,0,,they can kiss the championship goodbye.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.60,0:04:40.40,Default,,0,0,0,,So fast!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.40,0:04:44.24,Default,,0,0,0,,I have to—
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.84,0:04:48.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Swatted it!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.48,0:04:50.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Rebound.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.56,0:04:55.68,Default,,0,0,0,,It’s over.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.56,0:04:58.44,Default,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.08,0:05:00.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Don’t underestimate us.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.52,0:05:02.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Nice steal.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.47,0:05:05.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Jonie! Sparky!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.20,0:05:09.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Go, Weslie!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.28,0:05:11.16,Default,,0,0,0,,When did he—
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.36,0:05:13.36,Default,,0,0,0,,No matter what…
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.72,0:05:15.08,Default,,0,0,0,,We will definitely—
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.68,0:05:18.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Go!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.28,0:05:20.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Seize the chance!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.36,0:05:21.28,Default,,0,0,0,,We will definitely—
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.04,0:05:27.20,Default,,0,0,0,,It’s over—they’re really done for.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.92,0:05:29.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Let’s just end it here.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.72,0:05:33.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Get the ball—
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.32,0:05:35.56,Default,,0,0,0,,back to me!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.88,0:05:37.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Nice shot!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.36,0:05:39.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Great job!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.92,0:05:41.60,Default,,0,0,0,,That was awesome!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.80,0:05:44.72,Default,,0,0,0,,I’ll definitely get the ball to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.20,0:05:46.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Trust us.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.48,0:05:54.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Does that even need asking?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.88,0:05:59.52,Default,,0,0,0,,I…believe in you guys.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.72,0:06:02.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Pulling that move again?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.68,0:06:09.48,Default,,0,0,0,,This is interesting.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.28,0:06:17.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Let me see just how good you are.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.12,0:06:18.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Bring it on.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.88,0:06:33.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Hold the line!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.60,0:06:36.04,Default,,0,0,0,,You’re not scoring!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.12,0:06:40.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Score, Weslie!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.60,0:06:45.64,Default,,0,0,0,,I definitely…won’t let you guys down.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.12,0:07:04.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Weslie actually just dunked over Victor!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.60,0:07:09.48,Default,,0,0,0,,The game is heating up; the score between the goats and the wolves is neck and neck.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.68,0:07:14.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Only 30 seconds left, and it’s a one-point game.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.24,0:07:20.80,Default,,0,0,0,,I feel like, no matter the outcome…They’ve already won.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.60,0:07:23.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Look how happy they are right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.32,0:07:27.76,Default,,0,0,0,,This game is absolutely amazing.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.76,0:07:36.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Go Team Defenders! Go Team Wolves!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.16,0:07:39.00,Default,,0,0,0,,I never realized basketball was so much fun.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.04,0:07:40.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Let’s work hard together.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.64,0:07:43.08,Default,,0,0,0,,I want to prove that our Goat Clan can play great basketball too.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.08,0:07:44.52,Default,,0,0,0,,I want to participate in the Grassland Basketball Game.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.72,0:07:45.80,Default,,0,0,0,,I want to play basketball.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.80,0:07:47.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Basketball really is a magical sport.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.44,0:07:50.92,Default,,0,0,0,,I believe in him; he will definitely become the best basketball star player.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.92,0:07:53.68,Default,,0,0,0,,I will definitely become the basketball star player you look up to.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.12,0:07:58.56,Default,,0,0,0,,—Yeah, it’s made me more confident.　—Go, Wolffy!　—Go, Daddy!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.24,0:08:02.68,Default,,0,0,0,,—With this shot, I’m going to make everyone in the arena open their eyes and really see.　—This is a post-up move.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.12,0:08:05.04,Default,,0,0,0,,This is our basketball.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.04,0:08:07.44,Default,,0,0,0,,It keeps us moving forward.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.12,0:08:12.76,Default,,0,0,0,,I want to be as strong as Pantheress.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.76,0:08:15.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Giving it your all—that’s what makes competitive sports attractive.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.48,0:08:18.16,Default,,0,0,0,,It makes us stronger.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.56,0:08:23.32,Default,,0,0,0,,I don’t want to quit the team; I want to play basketball with everyone.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.32,0:08:25.56,Default,,0,0,0,,I just need to take the shot without hesitation.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.56,0:08:26.76,Default,,0,0,0,,I can do this.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.08,0:08:29.20,Default,,0,0,0,,It stops us from being lazy.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.00,0:08:32.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Guarding everyone?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.36,0:08:33.64,Default,,0,0,0,,I’m willing to give it a try.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.88,0:08:37.80,Default,,0,0,0,,As the center, I must guard the team’s defense until the very last second.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.12,0:08:41.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Let’s share the joy of working hard and growing together.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.92,0:08:47.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Please teach me how to play basketball.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.64,0:08:49.36,Default,,0,0,0,,I want to enter the Basketball Game and win the championship.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.56,0:08:51.00,Default,,0,0,0,,See you next time; my name is Pantheress.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.12,0:08:51.76,Default,,0,0,0,,My name is…Vector.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.12,0:08:55.16,Default,,0,0,0,,I almost forgot—playing basketball is such a joyful thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.32,0:08:57.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Go! Do it!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.28,0:09:09.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.80,0:09:11.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Let’s go.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.64,0:09:27.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Ever since the Basketball Game ended, the Goats’ Village has changed.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.48,0:09:32.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Watch this three-pointer!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.64,0:09:42.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Look at Weslie—his foot injury just healed, and he’s already back on the court.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.96,0:09:44.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Nice shot.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.68,0:09:48.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Master, you’ve done a great job training Team Defenders.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.96,0:09:53.48,Default,,0,0,0,,It wasn’t me teaching them; it was them teaching me.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.68,0:09:58.68,Default,,0,0,0,,They reignited my passion for basketball and taught me to believe in the power of team play.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.68,0:10:01.76,Default,,0,0,0,,They proved to me that basketball isn’t just a sport—
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.08,0:10:05.76,Default,,0,0,0,,it’s a spirit that creates infinite possibilities.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.52,0:10:09.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, I believe they’ll create even more miracles in the future.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.52,0:10:13.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Wolffy, we’re opponents again.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.76,0:10:14.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.80,0:10:38.88,lyrics,,0,0,0,,Fiery passion ignites like sparks
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.88,0:10:42.84,lyrics,,0,0,0,,Boldly charging towards the final victory
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.84,0:10:50.72,lyrics,,0,0,0,,Friends cheer us on, fueling our spirit
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.72,0:10:54.52,lyrics,,0,0,0,,Continuously moving forward, staying true to ourselves
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.52,0:10:58.80,lyrics,,0,0,0,,Flying towards the miracle that belongs to us
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.80,0:11:02.84,lyrics,,0,0,0,,Sweat pouring on this court
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.84,0:11:06.84,lyrics,,0,0,0,,Step forward and rush towards the hoop of hope
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.84,0:11:10.80,lyrics,,0,0,0,,Leaping vigorously on the stage of youth
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.80,0:11:14.64,lyrics,,0,0,0,,Running with speed
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.64,0:11:18.64,lyrics,,0,0,0,,Proud and brave
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.96,0:11:22.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Congratulations to Team Wolves on winning the championship!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.32,0:11:24.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Their fierce battle against Team Defenders
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.20,0:11:27.16,Default,,0,0,0,,brought this Basketball Game to a perfect conclusion.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.56,0:11:30.56,Default,,0,0,0,,So, what is your wish?
Dialogue: 1,0:11:18.74,0:11:22.74,lyrics1,,0,0,0,,♪ Step forward and rush towards the hoop of hope ♪
Dialogue: 1,0:11:22.74,0:11:26.70,lyrics1,,0,0,0,,♪ Leaping vigorously on the stage of youth ♪
Dialogue: 1,0:11:26.70,0:11:30.54,lyrics1,,0,0,0,,♪ Running with speed ♪
Dialogue: 1,0:11:30.54,0:11:34.54,lyrics1,,0,0,0,,♪ Proud and brave ♪
Dialogue: 1,0:11:34.80,0:11:38.64,lyrics1,,0,0,0,,♪ Step forward and rush towards the hoop of hope ♪
Dialogue: 1,0:11:38.76,0:11:42.86,lyrics1,,0,0,0,,♪ Dreams relentlessly breaking through the soil ♪
Dialogue: 1,0:11:42.86,0:11:51.78,lyrics1,,0,0,0,,♪ Writing the champion’s anthem with hard work ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.48,0:11:42.48,Default,,0,0,0,,My wish?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.04,0:11:48.96,Default,,0,0,0,,My wish is to take our basketball game even further!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.40,0:12:02.40,Default,,0,0,0,,I don’t see any “Doctor” here.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.28,0:12:04.76,Default,,0,0,0,,He probably left.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.36,0:12:07.56,Default,,0,0,0,,So, who exactly is the Doctor?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.56,0:12:09.44,Default,,0,0,0,,I have no idea.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.76,0:12:12.52,Default,,0,0,0,,A month before this Basketball Game was set to begin,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.60,0:12:15.76,Default,,0,0,0,,he suddenly approached me, proposing a deal.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.88,0:12:19.64,Default,,0,0,0,,He would help me win the championship, and in return, I had to give him the Basketball Game’s wish.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.04,0:12:22.76,Default,,0,0,0,,According to my analysis,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.76,0:12:26.28,Default,,0,0,0,,these robots do not belong to our era.
Comment: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:05.00,Default,,0,0,0,,------------------------------------------------------
